<!--
    The small icon in the status bar and beside the notification.

    Deliberately not the launcher mark. Android draws a small icon as a silhouette: from API 21
    it discards every colour and keeps only the alpha, so the gold ring, the blue field and the
    handshake would all come out as one flat white blob. A bell survives that treatment, which
    is the whole reason this shape exists as a separate resource.

    White on transparent, 24dp, as the platform requires.
-->
